{"title":"성좌들이 나만 좋아해","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=byB2Pl/hzXarS1l6n/hHcpMFaNoBqI5looeWt3O0&filename=th3","synopsis":"미스테리한 탑이 생겨나면서 세상이 멸망했다.\n탑은 오로지 자신의 주위에만 빛을 내려 인간들의\n유일한 터전이 되어 주었다.\n이에 인간들은 탑의 정상에 모든 비밀이 있을거란 믿음으로\n탑을 오르기 시작했다.\n그 과정에서 인간을 초월한 성과를 이룬 자들은\n탑의 정상에 별자리로 새겨지며 '성좌'라는 칭호를 얻게 되었는데\n회귀를 반복하던 백호민은 비밀스런 성좌들의\n도움을 받으며 탑을 오르게 된다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":242,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":294,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":259,"change":{"type":"up","amount":35}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":294,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-24","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-25","rank":292,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-30","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":298,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":300,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":3885486,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":3885601,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":3885675,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":3885758,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":3885816,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":3885863,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":3886028,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":3886105,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":3886194,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":3886300,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-21","v":3886360,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc":2627},{"date":"2026-10-22","v":3886437,"rc":11750,"rs":109889,"cc